&lt;script src="https://strava-embeds.com/embed.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</description></item><item><title>Having Fun on Mallorcan Roads</title><link>/adventures/2025/having-fun-on-mallorcan-roads/</link><pubDate>Thu, 10 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0300</pubDate><guid>/adventures/2025/having-fun-on-mallorcan-roads/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;In April, my friend and I spent five unforgettable days cycling through the stunning roads of Mallorca. From the coastlines to the mountains, the island offered a perfect mix of scenic views, challenging climbs, and thrilling descents. Whether riding along the crystal-clear waters or through charming villages, we discovered the true beauty of Mallorca one pedal stroke at a time. This collection captures our adventure across the island, showcasing some of the best routes that combine fun, challenge, and breathtaking landscapes.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Brevet 200</title><link>/adventures/2024/brevet-200-2/</link><pubDate>Sat, 14 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0300</pubDate><guid>/adventures/2024/brevet-200-2/</guid><description>&lt;div class="strava-embed-placeholder" data-embed-type="activity" data-embed-id="12406576251"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

